      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New WooCommerce product to Slack\n\n**Purpose**: n8n workflow: New WooCommerce product to Slack. 3 nodes wired together. Uses: wooCommerceTrigger, slack, stopAndError. Sourced from czlonkowski/Zie619 n8n-workflows community archive (workflows/Woocommerce/1148_Woocommerce_Slack_Create_Triggered.json). Configure credentials and any hardcoded IDs before activating.\n\n**Services needed**: wooCommerceTrigger, slack, stopAndError\n\n**Difficulty**: auto-deploy\n\n**Setup**:\n1. Configure credentials for the services above\n2. Update any hardcoded IDs / URLs\n3. Test with sample data before activating\n\n_Source: https://github.com/Zie619/n8n-workflows_\n_Curated by ai-ops-architect on 2026-05-05_",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 480
      },
      "name": "Setup Guide (delete after configuring)",
